export function startPairs(s,o={}){return change(s,c=>{if(own(c,'seedPairs'))return rootShape(c.seedPairs);const source=pairSource();c.seedPairs={version:1,source,page:'draw',mode:'keep',branch:{first:null,second:null},treeSeen:false,theorySeen:false,learnSeen:1,folded:false,taskId:source.order[0],tasks:{[source.order[0]]:workFrom(source.tasks[source.order[0]])},runs:[],currentRun:{keep:null,return:null},nextId:1};return true;},o);}
